      "text": "(1) For all real a, sigma, Delta mu, t > 0 and every real C, eff(a, sigma, t Delta mu, C) = t^3 eff(a, sigma, Delta mu, C), where eff(a, sigma, Delta mu, C) = C (3 Delta mu / (2 a sigma))^3. (2) In every real inner-product space, for nonzero n and m, eta(n, m) = <n,m>^2 / (|n|^2 |m|^2) satisfies 0 <= eta(n, m) <= 1.",
